==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|eo}} [[urbs]], [[city]]

===Noun===
{{eo-noun}}

# [[city]], [[town]]
#: Des Moines estas usona '''urbo''' kun Francia nomo.
#: ''Des Moines  is an American '''city''' with a French name.''

====Derived terms====
* [[ĉefurbo]]: [[capital]] (city)
* [[urba]]: [[urban]]
* [[urbano]]: [[city-dweller]], [[city slicker]]
* [[urbcentro]]: [[downtown]]
* [[urbdomo]]: [[city hall]]
* [[urbego]]: [[metropolis]]
* [[urbestro]]: [[mayor]]
* [[urbeto]]: [[town]]
* [[urbomezo]]: center of town, downtown
* [[urbumi]]: to go downtown, to go to the city, to wander the streets of a city.

